+      tags:
+        - Anchoring
+      summary: Get an anchor by anchor id (or by document id, for backwards compatibility)
+      description: "Returns the authoritative state of one anchor. An id that is not an anchor id is
+        looked up as a document id. A simulated placeholder is surfaced as simulatedTxRef with
+        simulated: true, never as transactionHash (KS-587). Platform S polls this for every
+        in-flight anchor."
